alues_named": {"value": "一本简约风格杂志封面，杂志上写着“Flux.3-Kelin”，使用简约的瑞士排版，配色为美式配色灵感西部黄昏，色号为\n#C88A5B\n#5D6D88\n#D4C18D\n#6F7D5B\n"}}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [226.56126277153626, 449.0795383978859], "pos": [1480.3526985440371, 1563.3272769308157], "widgets_values": ["A minimalist magazine cover in a clean Swiss graphic layout, using only the western sunset palette #C88A5B, #5D6D88, #D4C18D, and #6F7D5B. The background is divided into broad geometric bands: a muted blue-gray upper field, a low western horizon in dusty ochre #C88A5B, and a large flat setting sun in pale gold #D4C18D above layered sage-green #6F7D5B prairie silhouettes. Across the top, a narrow white masthead strip carries the small uppercase title \"WILD & SMALL\" in widely spaced dark blue-gray sans-serif letters. Centered below it, the main magazine name \"Flux.3-Kelin\" appears in large, bold, precise Swiss-style typography, with “Flux.” set in #5D6D88 and “.3-Kelin” in #C88A5B. A cream-colored kitten sits near the center-left, shown as a simple flat editorial cutout with pointed ears, compact body, and minimal facial details. Beneath the masthead area, the large cream kitten occupies the central block labeled by generous negative space, facing forward against the sunset. On the right of the kitten stands one red mushroom with a rounded #C88A5B cap and a short #D4C18D stem, rendered as a simplified red mushroom form. Below the mushroom, a single red mushroom with a saturated red cap rests at lower center-right, aligned to the grid. Near the bottom-right, a second red mushroom motif is replaced by the specified red mushroom object: a single red mushroom with a broad red cap and pale stem stands beside a white daisy with a #D4C18D center. The specified red mushroom object is placed at 514, 468, 838, 829 as a prominent red mushroom with a rounded cap, while the white daisy at 649, 865, 838, 1000 forms a small white daisy cropped by the right edge. The cream kitten remains at 378, 108, 838, 432, and the red mushroom at 514, 468, 838, 829. Thin rules organize the composition, with the large headline \"Flux.3-Kelin\" above the cream kitten and the smaller text \"WILD & SMALL\" along the top margin. At the bottom, a restrained line of tiny uppercase text reads \"WESTERN TWILIGHT EDITION\" in #5D6D88. Crisp edges, strict alignment, ample empty space, flat colors, no gradients, and no photographic texture beyond the simplified geometric sunset."], "inputs": [{"name": "anything", "link": 797, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 529, "type": "ShowAnything|Mie", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowAnything|Mie"}, "order": 15, "widgets_values_named": {"displaytext": "A minimalist magazine cover in a clean Swiss graphic layout, using only the western sunset palette #C88A5B, #5D6D88, #D4C18D, and #6F7D5B. The background is divided into broad geometric bands: a muted blue-gray upper field, a low western horizon in dusty ochre #C88A5B, and a large flat setting sun in pale gold #D4C18D above layered sage-green #6F7D5B prairie silhouettes. Across the top, a narrow white masthead strip carries the small uppercase title \"WILD & SMALL\" in widely spaced dark blue-gray sans-serif letters. Centered below it, the main magazine name \"Flux.3-Kelin\" appears in large, bold, precise Swiss-style typography, with “Flux.” set in #5D6D88 and “.3-Kelin” in #C88A5B. A cream-colored kitten sits near the center-left, shown as a simple flat editorial cutout with pointed ears, compact body, and minimal facial details. Beneath the masthead area, the large cream kitten occupies the central block labeled by generous negative space, facing forward against the sunset. On the right of the kitten stands one red mushroom with a rounded #C88A5B cap and a short #D4C18D stem, rendered as a simplified red mushroom form. Below the mushroom, a single red mushroom with a saturated red cap rests at lower center-right, aligned to the grid. Near the bottom-right, a second red mushroom motif is replaced by the specified red mushroom object: a single red mushroom with a broad red cap and pale stem stands beside a white daisy with a #D4C18D center. The specified red mushroom object is placed at 514, 468, 838, 829 as a prominent red mushroom with a rounded cap, while the white daisy at 649, 865, 838, 1000 forms a small white daisy cropped by the right edge. The cream kitten remains at 378, 108, 838, 432, and the red mushroom at 514, 468, 838, 829. Thin rules organize the composition, with the large headline \"Flux.3-Kelin\" above the cream kitten and the smaller text \"WILD & SMALL\" along the top margin. At the bottom, a restrained line of tiny uppercase text reads \"WESTERN TWILIGHT EDITION\" in #5D6D88. Crisp edges, strict alignment, ample empty space, flat colors, no gradients, and no photographic texture beyond the simplified geometric sunset."}}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "pixaromaGroups": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.57.1", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [95.90929974891075, -1593.0089667040286], "scale": 0.4177248169415666}}, "groups": [{"color": "#02c39a", "flags": {}, "id": 44, "title": "🐏Prompt / 提示词", "bounding": [393.7164781706176, 2519.061327553234, 842.5094971793669, 514.4248583570984]}, {"color": "#02c39a", "flags": {}, "id": 45, "title": "🐏Image Size / 图片尺寸", "bounding": [393.71610139722435, 3044.465430194453, 843.0122090003717, 307.45962279607375]}, {"color": "#02c39a", "flags": {}, "id": 46, "title": "🐏Sampling & Scheduling / 采样与调度", "bounding": [1246.827683796799, 2519.0346640799253, 419.6778439891473, 830.1612048289248]}, {"color": "#02c39a", "flags": {}, "id": 47, "title": "🐏Decode & Image Save / 图像解码与保存", "bounding": [1678.951858130447, 2517.69745